*is* the case here) missing things: the mines - both because of their
layout, them frequently being dark and containing boulders. Sokoban:
because of pits, holes and boulders. And finally the level you enter
Medusa from - because of the water, statues and traps. If you don't see
it, you don't find it. However all those *can* be eliminated quite
easily with an uncursed potion of object detection for each level of
each. Only to be done if you're missing something *crucial* - not rings
of levitatoin - ever. 

